SUMMARY:Calfresh Update
DESCRIPTION:Beginning June 1st\, if you are working towards an associate 
 degree (2 year) or transferring for a B.A. (4 year) your chances of quali
 fying for Calfresh (formerly food stamps) without a work requirement has 
 just expanded!To apply\, click here to go to the BenefitsCal website. (ht
 tps://benefitscal.com/)&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Beginning June 1st\, if you are working
  towards an associate degree (2 year) or transferring for a B.A. (4 year)
  your chances of qualifying for Calfresh (formerly food stamps) without a
  work requirement has just expanded!</p><p><a href="https://benefitscal.c
 om/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">To apply\, click here to go to the Be
 nefitsCal website.</a>&#160\;</p>
